  era: "Section 16 \xB7 Mughal Empire \xB7 1526 \u2013 1857"
  title: Mughal literature
  text: 'Persian literature thrived: Abul Fazl''s Akbarnama and Ain-i-Akbari, Persian translations of the Mahabharata and Ramayana, and Dara Shikoh''s work on the Upanishads. Tulsidas wrote the Ramcharitmanas during Akbar''s reign.'
